sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (reviewer)
  participant P as review page (file://)
  participant LS as localStorage
  participant J as plan-comments.json
  participant A as gogo-analyst
  participant D as plan.md / plan-detail.md

  Note over P: built by gogo-view or cli/internal/pages<br/>with the comments JSON inlined
  P->>P: resolve anchors (hash at line, else search, else orphan)
  U->>P: click line 42 in plan-detail.md
  P->>U: composer at that line
  U->>P: save comment
  P->>LS: draft state (gogo-view:comments:&lt;slug&gt;)
  U->>P: click a flowchart node (div.vnm-node[data-id])
  P->>LS: thread doc=diagram:flow node=xplan
  U->>P: answer question D1 (option + free text)
  P->>LS: questions[].answer / answerText
  U->>P: Send review
  P->>J: save into .gogo/work/feature-&lt;slug&gt;/ (FS Access grant)
  Note over P,J: no API -> Blob download fallback + printed destination
  U->>A: /gogo:plan &lt;slug&gt; (re-entry)
  A->>J: read open threads + answered questions
  A->>J: append ai replies, mark resolved
  A->>D: revise the plan (delta logged in adjustments.md)
  A->>U: rebuilt page shows replies - unmatched threads in global comments
